  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the curve, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> represented by the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, passes through the intersection of the lines, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>|</mo></math> is equal to ___ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now integrate</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now point of intersection of lines are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
